    "license": "cc-by-4.0",
    "description": "Satellite-derived river width observations at 13 gauge stations in the Congo river basin, combining Landsat and Sentinel-2 observations. The basin-wide Parquet file contains irregularly sampled time series identified by gauge name, SWORD v17 reach ID and satellite mission. The time column records observation timestamps, w is estimated river width in metres, and gauge_lon and gauge_lat locate the gauge stations in longitude and latitude. Produced by the Institute of Geodesy (GIS), University of Stuttgart, for the ESA EO4FLOOD project.",
    "start_datetime": "1984-06-01T00:00:00Z",
